      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠠᠮᠪᠠᠶᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bambayiqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бамбайх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BAMBAI-</transcript>
      <definition>v, i. To bulge, swell, be thick, puffed up; to be or feel uncomfortable, clumsy or awkward;. to be soft, downy. '</definition>
      <page>81</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠤᠭᠲᠤᠢ ᠬᠠᠴᠠᠷ ᠪᠠᠮᠪᠠᠶᠢᠲᠠᠯ᠎ᠠ ᠬᠠᠪᠤᠳᠪᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>duγtui dotur-a caγasu --mui</transcript>
          <definition> The envelope is bulging with paper.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠢᠨᠤ ᠬᠠᠴᠠᠷ ᠪᠠᠮᠪᠠᠶᠢᠲᠠᠯ᠎ᠠ ᠬᠠᠪᠤᠳᠪᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>minu xacar --tal-a xabudba</transcript>
          <definition>My cheek is puffed up or swollen.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
